{
  "slug": "android-kmp-playbook",
  "name": "Android Kmp Playbook",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Comprehensive Claude Code toolkit for Android and Kotlin Multiplatform (KMP)  many skills, sub-agents, and command enforcing Clean Architecture, Jetpack Compose best\npractices, KMP patterns, coroutines, TDD, Wear OS, TV, XR, and more.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **16 skills**, **8 agents** and **1 command**.\n\n- **Skills** (16): `ci-cd-android` (GitHub Actions CI/CD for Android/KMP — Gradle caching, APK/AAB signing, Play Store deployment, iOS framework build, test reporting,…), `clean-architecture` (Structure Android/KMP projects in clean architecture layers — domain, data, presentation — with strict dependency inversion, layer contracts,…), `clean-code` (Enforce clean Kotlin: naming conventions, null safety (no !!), value classes, scope functions, sealed interfaces, expression bodies, immutability,…), `compose-stability` (Diagnose and fix Compose stability — @Stable, @Immutable, ImmutableList, strong skipping mode, compiler metrics, and lambda stability for…), `coroutines-flow` (Write safe Kotlin Coroutines and Flow code — structured concurrency, Flow operators, StateFlow, SharedFlow, error handling, cancellation, and…), `database-migration` (Safe database migrations for Android/KMP — Room AutoMigration and manual migrations, SQLDelight .sqm migration files, fallback strategies, and…), `dependency-injection` (Wire Android/KMP apps with Koin 4.x or Hilt — module declarations, scopes, qualifiers, ViewModel injection, KMP multiplatform modules,…), `jetpack-compose` (Write idiomatic Jetpack Compose UI — stateless composables, state hoisting, slot API, Modifier ordering, side effects, previews, accessibility,…), and 8 more\n- **Agents** (8): `ci-cd-optimizer` (GitHub Actions CI/CD optimizer for Android/KMP — Gradle caching, signing, Play Store deployment, test parallelization, Kover coverage, Firebase…), `compose-reviewer` (Jetpack Compose code reviewer — recomposition safety, stability, accessibility, Modifier ordering, side effects, and state hoisting violations), `migration-expert` (Database migration specialist for Android/KMP — Room AutoMigration, manual migrations, SQLDelight .sqm files, MigrationTestHelper, expand-contract pattern, and fallback…), `module-graph-auditor` (Android/KMP module graph auditor — detects illegal cross-module dependencies, layer boundary violations, missing convention plugins, feature-to-feature coupling, and…), `tdd-enforcer` (TDD workflow enforcer for Android/KMP — writes failing tests first, then implementation), `tv-developer` (Android TV implementation specialist — Compose for TV, D-pad focus management, TvLazyRow/TvLazyColumn, 10-foot UX, overscan margins, media playback,…), `wear-os-specialist` (Wear OS implementation specialist — Tiles API, complications, Horologist ScalingLazyColumn, SwipeDismissableNavHost, Health Services, ambient mode, and watch-face data…), `xr-specialist` (Android XR implementation specialist — Jetpack XR SDK, Subspace, SpatialPanel, Orbiter, GltfModel, spatial audio, gaze input, environment API,…)\n- **Commands** (1): `migrate`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install android-kmp-playbook@claude-community` from `rezaiyan/android-kmp-claude-playbook`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
